  "description": "A single 12-pack of premium eco-friendly printer ink cartridges (Model: HP 950XL) was purchased online from the official Meridian Partners supplier portal, with the order confirmation and receipt attached. The total cost was $68.25, and the items were delivered to the downtown office on April 5, 2024. The purchase was made under the standard office supplies requisition workflow, and the items are classified as consumables with no serial numbers or embedded electronics. The invoice specifies the original currency as USD and confirms delivery within 10 days of purchase.",
  "category": "office_supplies",
  "routing": "auto_approve",
  "rationale": "The claim is for a single consumable office supply (printer ink) under $75, with a receipt attached, and falls within the auto_approve criteria for office_supplies as per the routing policy."
